IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`

-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): PART 3 (continued), ARTICLES 23 AND 24, WITH SCHEDULES 4 TO 7.
-- Layer 1. Article 23 amends the Housing Benefit Regulations 2006 and article 24 the Housing Benefit (Persons who have
-- attained the qualifying age for state pension credit) Regulations 2006; neither is among the inputs. Every figure the
-- Order states is a value. Where the Order amends a sum "as it has effect in" a stated kind of case, that kind of case is
-- a plain input and a person outside it gets NOTHING (the Order does not touch the unmodified paragraph).
-- Dates: arts 23 and 24 come into force on 6th April 2026 where the rent is payable weekly and on 1st April 2026
-- otherwise (art 1(3)(h), uro-part1-intro).
-- Articles 23(1) and 24(1) ("a reference in this article to a numbered regulation or Schedule is a reference to ...")
-- are cross-reference conventions and are not encoded.

§ `Article 23 -- Housing Benefit`

