    `Housing Benefit regulation 27(3)(a)`
    `Housing Benefit regulation 27(3)(b)`

@ref art 23(2) (src:221-223)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sub-paragraph of regulation 27(3) of the Housing Benefit Regulations`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 23(2): the replaced and the replacing sum` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit regulation 27(3)(a)` THEN `art 23(2)(a): regulation 27(3)(a) of the Housing Benefit Regulations`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit regulation 27(3)(b)` THEN `art 23(2)(b): regulation 27(3)(b) of the Housing Benefit Regulations`


