DECLARE `a sub-paragraph of paragraph 2 of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations` IS ONE OF
    `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(2)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(2)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`

@ref art 23(4) (src:244-249)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sub-paragraph of paragraph 2 of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 23(4): the replaced and the replacing sum` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(2)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 23(4)(a): paragraph 2(2)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(2)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 23(4)(b): paragraph 2(2)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 23(4)(c): paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 23(4)(d): paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 23(4)(e): paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the ineligible service charge`


