-- out of text: Housing Benefit (Abolition of the Family Premium and date of claim) (Amendment) Regulations 2015 reg 4: whether the case falls within it is an input.
-- "as it has effect in a case falling within regulation 4 of the Housing Benefit (Abolition of the Family Premium and date
-- of claim) (Amendment) Regulations 2015": whether the case does is for those Regulations, so it is an input; outside
-- such a case the Order says nothing about the family premium.
@ref art 23(7) (src:257-259)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sub-paragraph of paragraph 3(1) of Part 2 of Schedule 3 to the Housing Benefit Regulations`
      `the case falls within regulation 4 of the Housing Benefit (Abolition of the Family Premium and date of claim) (Amendment) Regulations 2015` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `a sum and its replacement`
`art 23(7): the family premium sums in a case falling within regulation 4 of the 2015 Regulations` `which one` `the case falls within regulation 4 of the Housing Benefit (Abolition of the Family Premium and date of claim) (Amendment) Regulations 2015` MEANS
    IF `the case falls within regulation 4 of the Housing Benefit (Abolition of the Family Premium and date of claim) (Amendment) Regulations 2015`
    THEN JUST (`art 23(7): the replaced and the replacing family premium sum` `which one`)
    ELSE NOTHING

