DECLARE `a sub-paragraph of paragraph 2 of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations` IS ONE OF
    `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(2)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(2)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`
    `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1`

@ref art 24(4) (src:291-296)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sub-paragraph of paragraph 2 of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 24(4): the replaced and the replacing sum` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(2)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 24(4)(a): paragraph 2(2)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(2)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 24(4)(b): paragraph 2(2)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 24(4)(c): paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 24(4)(d): paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations, the ineligible service charge`
    WHEN `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` THEN `art 24(4)(e): paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1 to the Housing Benefit (SPC) Regulations, the ineligible service charge`


